messages:
Welcome! I've been waiting for you!{be01}
Let me introduce myself...
I am the Subway Boss Ingo.{be01}
What can I see after winning,
winning, and winning?{be01}
Where is my destination?{be01}
I've kept thinking, and
I've learned one thing.{be01}
That is, you cannot know what happens
after winning without winning.{be01}
Therefore, I will exert every possible
effort to battle with you.{be01}
All aboard!

I have won this time, but
your talent is very strong!{be01}
Your tactics...reading...
You have great skills.{be01}
That's right! I would like to
battle you again and again!{be01}
Please ride the Battle Subway again soon!

Bravo!
Excellent!!{be01}
I am glad that I fought so hard
against a wonderful Trainer like you.{be01}
That's right!
You grow stronger by matching yourself{be00}
against a strong opponent.{be01}
Please do your best and run
toward the destination--{be00}
an even higher state.
